@startuml db_entities
title Spectracs — DB entity model\nAPP DB (spectracsPy.db) + SERVER DB (spectracsPyServer.db) · SQLite via SQLAlchemy

hide circle
hide empty methods
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #333333
  BackgroundColor<<catalog>> #EEF6EE
  BorderColor<<catalog>> #4C7A4C
  BackgroundColor<<reference>> #EEF6EE
  BorderColor<<reference>> #4C7A4C
  BackgroundColor<<join>> #FFF7E6
  BorderColor<<join>> #B58900
  BackgroundColor<<stub>> #F2F2F2
  BorderColor<<stub>> #999999
  BackgroundColor<<server>> #EEF0FB
  BorderColor<<server>> #4C5FAF
  BackgroundColor<<planned>> #FDF3F7
  BorderColor<<planned>> #B84C7A
}

' Every entity has  id : String  (PK, uuid) from DbBaseEntityMixin.
' The two DBs are SEPARATE SQLite files (separate metadata); cross-DB links are SOFT string
' references (no enforceable FK) — drawn dashed (..>).

' ============ Application config (APP DB) ============
class ApplicationConfig {
  + id : String (PK)
}

class ApplicationConfigToSpectrometerProfile <<join>> {
  + application_config_id : String (PK, FK)
  + spectrometer_profile_id : String (PK, FK)
  + isDefault : Boolean
}

' ============ Core: device profile + calibration (APP DB) ============
class SpectrometerProfile {
  + id : String (PK)
  + serial : String
  + spectrometerId : String (FK)
  + spectrometerCalibrationProfileId : String (FK)
}

class SpectrometerCalibrationProfile {
  + id : String (PK)
  + regionOfInterestX1 : Integer
  + regionOfInterestY1 : Integer
  + regionOfInterestX2 : Integer
  + regionOfInterestY2 : Integer
  + interpolationCoefficientA : Float
  + interpolationCoefficientB : Float
  + interpolationCoefficientC : Float
  + interpolationCoefficientD : Float
}

class SpectralLine {
  + id : String (PK)
  + pixelIndex : Integer
  + spectrometerCalibrationProfile_id : String (FK)
  + spectralLineMasterDataId : String (FK)
}

class SpectralLineMasterData <<reference>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + name : String
  + colorName : String
  + mainColorName : String
  + nanometer : Float
}

' ============ Catalog: spectrometer + parts (APP DB) ============
class Spectrometer <<catalog>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + modelName : String
  + spectrometerSensorId : String (FK)
  + spectrometerVendorId : String (FK)
  + spectrometerStyleId : String (FK)
}

class SpectrometerSensor <<catalog>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + vendorId : String
  + vendorName : String
  + sellerName : String
  + modelId : String
  + description : String
  + codeName : String
  + isVirtual : Boolean
  + spectrometerSensorChipId : String (FK)
}

class SpectrometerSensorChip <<catalog>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + vendorName : String
  + productName : String
}

class SpectrometerStyle <<catalog>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + styleId : String
  + styleName : String
  + description : String
}

class SpectrometerVendor <<catalog>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + vendorName : String
  + vendorId : String
}

' ==== Workflow = the persisted record (APP DB) — SPEC_workflow_persistence.md, Option A / §9.5 (PLANNED) ====
' The runtime model/spectral classes ARE the entities (one class = runtime object + DB row).
class SpectralWorkflow <<planned>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + username : String        ' soft ref -> AppUser (stamped at Save)
  + userId : String          ' soft ref (the Home list FILTER key)
  + pluginCodeRef : String   ' soft ref -> DbPlugin.codeRef
  + pluginVersion : String   ' A3 provenance: exact resolved version; NULL = shipped built-in
  + timestampIso : String    ' sort key
}

class SpectralWorkflowPhase <<planned>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + workflowId : String (FK)
  + type : String            ' ACQUISITION | PROCESSING | EVALUATION | METADATA | PUBLISHING
}

class SpectralWorkflowStep <<planned>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + phaseId : String (FK)
  + role : String            ' REFERENCE | SAMPLE (acquisition steps)
  + label : String
  + persist : Boolean
}

class SpectraContainer <<planned>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + stepId : String (FK)      ' producedBy
}

class Spectrum <<planned>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + containerId : String (FK)
  + role : String            ' REFERENCE | SAMPLE | ABSORPTION | TRANSMISSION (bag key)
  + sampleType : String
  + valuesJson : String      ' the {nm:value} map, via Spectrum.toJson()/fromJson()
}

class EvaluationResult <<planned>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + stepId : String (FK)
  + resultJson : String      ' view-models via EvaluationResult.toJson() (VerdictView: roastState+hueDegrees)
}

class SpectralWorkflowMetadata <<planned>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + workflowId : String (FK)
  + name : String            ' field key; pumpkin: title | temperature | dateOfRoasting
  + label : String           ' plugin-declared, denormalized (self-describing)
  + type : String            ' TEXT | NUMBER | DATE
  + value : String           ' DATE = ISO yyyy-mm-dd
  + showInWorkflowsTable : Boolean      ' plugin-declared; true -> a Home-list column (pumpkin: title only)
  + order : Integer
}

' ============ Auth + plugin binding (SERVER DB — separate file) ============
class AppUser <<server>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + username : String (unique)
  + passwordHash : String
  + displayName : String
  + enabled : Boolean
  + pluginId : String (FK)          ' -> DbPlugin (same server DB)
  + spectrometerDevice : String     ' stable device code-name, e.g. "Virtuax"
}

class AppUserRole <<server>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + name : String (unique)
}

class AppUserToAppUserRole <<server>> {
  + app_user_id : String (PK, FK)
  + app_user_role_id : String (PK, FK)
}

class DbPlugin <<server>> {
  + id : String (PK)
  + title : String
  + codeRef : String
  + version : String
  + pdfRef : String
}

' ============ Relationships ============
ApplicationConfig "1" *-- "0..*" ApplicationConfigToSpectrometerProfile : spectrometerProfilesMapping
ApplicationConfigToSpectrometerProfile "0..*" --> "1" SpectrometerProfile : spectrometerProfile

SpectrometerProfile "0..*" --> "1" Spectrometer : spectrometer (shared)
SpectrometerProfile "1" *-- "0..1" SpectrometerCalibrationProfile : calibration (owned, no cascade declared)

SpectrometerCalibrationProfile "1" *-- "0..*" SpectralLine : spectralLines (cascade all, delete-orphan)
SpectralLine "0..*" --> "1" SpectralLineMasterData : masterData (reference)

Spectrometer "0..*" --> "1" SpectrometerSensor : sensor
Spectrometer "0..*" --> "1" SpectrometerVendor : vendor
Spectrometer "0..*" --> "1" SpectrometerStyle : style
SpectrometerSensor "0..*" --> "1" SpectrometerSensorChip : chip

' Workflow-is-the-record graph (Option A): parent owns children (cascade)
SpectralWorkflow "1" *-- "0..*" SpectralWorkflowPhase : phases (by type)
SpectralWorkflowPhase "1" *-- "0..*" SpectralWorkflowStep : steps
SpectralWorkflowStep "1" *-- "0..1" SpectraContainer : container
SpectralWorkflowStep "1" *-- "0..1" EvaluationResult : evaluationResult
SpectraContainer "1" *-- "0..*" Spectrum : spectra (by role)
SpectralWorkflow "1" *-- "0..*" SpectralWorkflowMetadata : metadataFields (cascade)

' Server-side auth + plugin binding (single server DB -> real FKs)
AppUser "1" *-- "0..*" AppUserToAppUserRole : roles
AppUserToAppUserRole "0..*" --> "1" AppUserRole : appUserRole
AppUser "0..*" --> "1" DbPlugin : plugin (FK)

' Cross-DB SOFT references (string id / code-name, no enforceable FK) — dashed
SpectralWorkflow ..> AppUser : username / userId
SpectralWorkflow ..> DbPlugin : pluginCodeRef
AppUser ..> SpectrometerSensor : spectrometerDevice = codeName

note bottom of SpectralWorkflow
  PLANNED (SPEC_workflow_persistence.md, Option A / concept §9.5). The workflow IS the record:
  the runtime model/spectral classes ARE the app-DB entities (one class = runtime object + DB row).
  Leaf maps are JSON columns ON their entity: Spectrum.valuesJson = Spectrum.toJson();
  EvaluationResult.resultJson = EvaluationResult.toJson(). No separate Db* twins.
  Cleanup: the dead DbSpectrum + MeasurementProfile stubs are DELETED.
  view / widget (Step), captured burst (Spectrum) = transient, NOT mapped.
  Metadata: plugin-declared generic (EAV) rows; relationship = metadataFields
  (NOT "metadata" — SQLAlchemy-reserved); showInWorkflowsTable -> a Home-list column.
end note

legend right
  Composition (<b>*--</b>) = owned: deleting the parent deletes the child.
  Arrow (<b>--></b>) = FK reference to a SHARED row (same DB).
  Dashed (<b>..></b>) = SOFT cross-DB reference (string id / code-name, no FK).
  <b><<catalog>></b> / <b><<reference>></b> = shared lookup data (app DB).
  <b><<join>></b> = association row (registration mapping).
  <b><<server>></b> = SERVER DB (spectracsPyServer.db, separate file).
  <b><<planned>></b> = designed (SPEC_workflow_persistence.md), not yet built.
endlegend

@enduml
